{"always_run_in_app": true, "icon": {"color": "deep-blue", "glyph": "plus"}, "name": "ICU 抗菌药物 v17", "script": "const html = Data.fromBase64String(\"\").toRawString();\nconst view = new WebView();\nview.shouldAllowRequest = request => /^about:blank(?:#.*)?$/.test(request.url);\nawait view.loadHTML(html);\nawait view.present(true);\nScript.complete();\n", "share_sheet_inputs": []}